      "text": "judges receive senum of silver each day, Alma 11:3. a senum of silver is equal to senine of gold, Alma 11:3, 7. two senums equal one amnor, Alma 11:11. four senums equal one ezrom, Alma 11:12. shiblon is half of senum, Alma 11:15.",
